    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 72 read with Section 71 of the Finance Act, No. 11 of 1963, I, MangalaSamaraweera, Minister of Finance and Mass Media, do by this Order, vest in the People's Bank established under thePeople's Bank Act, No. 29 of 1961, with effect from 06th July Two Thousand and Eighteen, the properties described in theSchedule hereto.",
