      620.68
    ],
    "text": "All that divided one sixths share (1/6), one sixteenths share (1/16), and one eights share (1/8) from and out of theland called, \u201cPanvile Kumbura\u201d depicted in the Title Plan No. 414393 situated in Gramasewa Division of Ambana, No. 94,Divisional Secretary's Division of Elpitiya in Benthara Walallavita Korale in the District of Galle in the Southern Provinceand bounded on the North by : foot path, on the East by : the road, lands depicted in the Title Plans No. 331300, 327968and 390496 and Lot No. 122 1/2, on the South and West by : Beligasyaya Canal containing in extent of one acre, two roodsand sixteen perches (01 A., 02 R., 16 P.) together with everything standing thereon.",
